Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.60,0:00:08.50,TitleGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,460)\fad(500,400)\blur2.5}Glimpse of Us\N{\fs88\fsp6\b0}Joji
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.80,0:00:24.80,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}She'd take the world off my shoulders\NIf it was ever hard to move
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.20,0:00:33.20,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}She'd turn the rain to a rainbow\NWhen I was living in the blue
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.80,0:00:41.80,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}Why then, if she's so perfect\NDo I still wish that it was you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.20,0:00:49.80,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}Perfect don't mean that it's working\NSo what can I do? (Ooh)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.10,0:00:57.80,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}When you're out of sight\NIn my mind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.40,0:01:06.80,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}'Cause sometimes I look in her eyes\NAnd that's where I find a glimpse of us
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.10,0:01:15.20,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}And I try to fall for her touch\NBut I'm thinking of the way it was
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.50,0:01:23.20,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}Said, "I'm fine" and said, "I moved on"\NI'm only here passing time in her arms
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.60,0:01:32.50,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}Hoping I'll find\NA glimpse of us
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.20,0:01:41.20,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}Tell me he savors your glory\NDoes he laugh the way I did?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.60,0:01:49.80,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}Is this a part of your story?\NOne that I had never lived
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.20,0:01:58.20,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}Maybe one day, you'll feel lonely\NAnd in his eyes, you'll get a glimpse
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.50,0:02:06.00,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}Maybe you'll start slipping slowly\NAnd find me again
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.30,0:02:14.50,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}When you're out of sight\NIn my mind
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.80,0:02:23.20,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}'Cause sometimes I look in her eyes\NAnd that's where I find a glimpse of us
